                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>On November 28, 1950, Secretary of State Acheson appeared in executive session
                    before the Senate Foreign Relations Committee to discuss the world situation in
                    light of Chinese Communist intervention in Korea (November 25–27). For the
                    record of his testimony, see <hi rendition="#italic">Reviews of the World
                        Situation, 1949–1950: Hearings Held in Executive Session Before the
                        Committee on Foreign Relations, United States Senate</hi> (81st Cong., 1st
                    and 2nd sessions), pages 367–395.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
